  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "$5÷\\frac{1}{12}=$",
  "worked_solution": "Dividing a whole number by a fraction is equivalent to multiplying the whole number by the reciprocal of the fraction.\n\nThe reciprocal of $\\frac{1}{12}$ is $12.$ \n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n5÷\\frac{1}{12}=5\\times 12=60.\n$$",
